{
  "_meta": {
    "category": "overlays",
    "description": "Compose batch of one reference slot (control treatment arm) plus three target slots (three audience filters over the variant arm) over region x segment decorated with an OVERLAY_PROP_Z_PANEL multi-reference compose overlay that runs pairwise two-proportion z-tests across the N+1=4 slot panel. Multi-ref panel sibling of the single-target OVERLAY_PROP_Z_CELL (13_compose_prop_z_cell.json). Each cell's Value is a flattened upper-triangular slice of pairwise two-sided p-values across the panel (slice length = M*(M-1)/2 for an M=N+1 slot panel). Reuses the same twoProportionZ helper backing TEST_PROP_Z / OVERLAY_PROP_Z_CELL — every pairwise p-value matches the corresponding OVERLAY_PROP_Z_CELL output byte-for-byte. Cap enforcement via OverlayOptions.MaxPanelTargets defaults to 16 when Options is nil — three targets clears the default cap. Inherently buffered (inferential family).",
    "name": "compose-prop-z-panel",
    "operators": [
      "AGG_COUNT",
      "FILTER_INCLUDE",
      "GROUP_CATEGORY"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "compose",
      "cross-tabulation",
      "experiment-analysis",
      "hypothesis-test",
      "overlay",
      "proportion-analysis"
    ]
  },
  "requests": [
